   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "How it forms",
   "texto": [
    "The conditional is formed with **бы** and the past of the verb: **я бы купил**, **ты бы пошла**, **мы бы поехали**. The past is gender and number.",
    "**Бы** is an atone particle that is written separately and cannot start the subordinate: **я бы купил** / **я купил бы**. Your position may change according to what word you want to highlight."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "If it were...",
   "texto": [
    "With **если бы** you put forward a hypothesis: **Если бы у меня были деньги, я бы путешествовал** (if I had money, I would travel). In the condition the past is used; in the result, **бы** + past. **Богат** is the masculine short form of **богатый**.",
    "Do not confuse it with a real condition: **Если у меня есть деньги** means «If I have money» and is used without **бы**."
